779	     * Resolve this owner's effective {@code membershipLevel}: the capped value stored on the owner
780	     * when present (the create-time level after the household ceiling has been applied, see
781	     * {@link #getMembershipLevel()}), otherwise the level recomputed from the owner's membership
782	     * points (see {@link #membershipLevel(int)} and
783	     * {@link #membershipPoints(Integer, String, Integer, LocalDate)}). This is the single source of
784	     * truth for how a stored level is read back, deferred to by both the create-time household-ceiling
785	     * computation and the read-side DTO mapping so they always agree.
786	     *
787	     * @return the stored capped level when present, otherwise the level derived from membership points
