806	    /**
807	     * Derive an owner's {@code locality}, the canonical region for the owner, from the {@code REGION}
808	     * segment of the owner's {@code customerCode} (see {@link #customerCode(String, String, String)}).
809	     * Because the customer code's region is itself derived from the postcode, the locality now shares
810	     * the owner's region-and-hash identity: it is the text before the first {@code '-'} of the customer
811	     * code. When the owner has no customer code the locality is {@code 'UNKNOWN'}.
